Digital 3D rendering of a humanoid robot, fully articulated with hollow skeletal structure and mechanical muscles. The robot features: 
- Torso and abdomen in bright red PETG, strong, solid with visible internal ribs
- Head, hands, feet, and fingers/toes in shiny gold PLA Silk, smooth and reflective
- Arms and legs in matte black PLA, lightweight
- Arduino Nano in head and Arduino Mega/ESP32 in torso visible through clear panels
- DC motors and cables integrated, servo drivers, IMU sensors clearly visible
- All joints fully articulated, humanoid proportions, realistic mechanical detail
- Lighting: soft, neutral, highlighting contours and materials
- Background: neutral gray to enhance color contrast
- Style: photorealistic, high-detail 3D rendering
